{"id":275,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It lives quietly in the deep forest. It is said to create chilly winter winds with the fans it holds."},{"games":["Sword","X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"A Pokémon that was feared as a forest guardian. It can read the foe’s mind and take preemptive action."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Shiftry’s large fans generate awesome gusts of wind at a speed close to 100 feet per second. The whipped-up wind blows anything away. This Pokémon chooses to live quietly deep in forests."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Shiftry is a mysterious Pokémon that is said to live atop towering trees dating back over a thousand years. It creates terrific windstorms with the fans it holds."},{"games":["Y"],"text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 feet per second that can level houses."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"By flapping its leafy fan, it can whip up gusts of 100 ft/second that can level houses."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It is said to arrive on chilly, wintry winds. Feared from long ago as the guardian of forests, this POKéMON lives in a deep forest where people do not venture."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Wind Rider","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Attack stat if Tailwind takes effect or if the Pokémon is hit by a wind move. The Pokémon also takes no damage from wind moves."},{"name":"Pickpocket","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon steals the held item from attackers that made direct contact with it."}],"eggGroups":["Field","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":273,"name":"Seedot","condition":null,"children":[{"id":274,"name":"Nuzleaf","condition":"Lv. 14","child